<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-11T15:34:05.767Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:34:05 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Three men were sentenced for murdering Australian surfer brothers and their American friend during a surf trip in Mexico, while journalist Hamurabi Huesca Manzano was killed in Oaxaca. A prison clash in Sinaloa state left ten people dead, adding to earlier prison violence that also killed ten and injured many. These events show cartel-linked attacks on civilians, journalists and prison populations. The conflict’s lethality is long‑standing, with 37 battle‑related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNU18tcnNhTGdLbTAwR01DYmZvb082OU9vT1I5RkUyTlJsMTBqaHhQTTEzTTBhbVlwaWRqdmNXdFFuZFpQcE5POGpqdjJKUWllUUNLT3dCTjJJRkp6SkZaZ2hKd3dvUHBUdGdCaUF4LWpVenZaUzR4eExpeWdkeXo0OXh2WW53YUhLUjNhUTZNNTByZHRoSE1WMzlSTm5Ba2RZeWloaG1KVEZtVVVTSFd2VnZzTDBuSm56dUVaYXM2bXlBTUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5URjRXUjlHSmFuVWpYQnYzZFlUN090QVVQeWRDUmQ4MUwzS05sVzVhR2N1dTJBQjlmTTd6a0tZRkNDZUV5eG1DNEd5UDRabW0tTC1DdWdxd085dmk5UUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPdUl5WTRidGtjLU45TV83d1hOQjZqWGRUaFBjcDBKb3NWX3I0UHo1ODNoY0pxWjdMaG9jd1FZZ0Rmd2lCdXZDQkNvbm54YzJXSmpPMEIwYmV1U0lLOFF6TF9zaEt5RnlWdjd2VEtCbGFjY0M0NDdXWGY1elNzdVN0eTJzY01XSWZWZzBwV2hLQWZRcXZvamE5eHBwa3JoMF9ZNF84NlJYRy1nYndP?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a